WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.725
Here's Google's starting point.

2
00:00:01.725 --> 00:00:05.555
Google Cloud's REST reference
documents the project events list,

3
00:00:05.555 --> 00:00:08.675
with its permission, and an
organization equivalent.

4
00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:13.688
The event resource has a category whose
only value is incident, plus a state,

5
00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:15.790
a detailed category, relevance,

6
00:00:15.790 --> 00:00:19.913
its impacts by product and
location, and its updates over time.

7
00:00:19.913 --> 00:00:21.688
Planned maintenance isn't in it.

8
00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:24.463
The API is enabled once per project.

9
00:00:24.463 --> 00:00:27.449
The Personalized Service
Health Viewer role reads it.

10
00:00:27.449 --> 00:00:31.440
And the command line lists a project's
events at the global location.
